  "job_B1.3.11_20261116_194558": {
    "chunk_text": "don \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6dlan h\u00e6le. Eft \u00e6t sumon s\u00e6le \u00fea Petrus si\u00feode neosigenne \u00fea geleaffullan, \u00fea becom he to Liddan, wolde \u00f0a \u00dea gemette he anne b\u00e6drydan binnon \u00feam weallum, Eneas gehaten, for eahte gearum lama. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se eadiga Petrus to \u00feam earman b\u00e6ddrydan, geh\u00e6le \u00f0e drihten Crist, aris and do \u00fee gearowne. \u00dea aras se b\u00e6ddryda unbunden fram Petre, se \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fea mihte \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6g unbinden \u00fea f\u00e6stan cnottan \u00dea gelyfde seo burhwaru, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s b\u00e6ddrydan h\u00e6le,on \u00feone so\u00f0an God, and gecyrde to fulluhte, and Ioppe hatte sum burh, gehende \u00fe\u00e6re Liddan, on \u00fe\u00e6re w\u00e6s an wydewe wel gelyfed, Thabitas geciged, Seo wear\u00f0 geuntrumad on \u00feam ylcan timan, gewat \u00fea of life, and l\u00e6g on uppflora. \u00dea geaxodon \u00fea geleaffullan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t lic bes\u00e6tan \u00fe\u00e6t Petrus w\u00e6s on Liddan, \u00feam lande swa gehende, \u00dea aras se apostol and ardlice \u00feider com, eode to \u00fe\u00e6re uppflora, and efne him embe stodon wepende \u00dea het se halga Petrus \u00fe\u00e6t hi him \u00fe\u00e6t hus gerymdon, and gebigde his cneowa biddende hire lifes. Wende \u00fea to \u00feam lice and hlude clypode, Thabita aris, and heo \u00fe\u00e6rrihte geedcucode, beseah to Petre, \u00dea gel\u00e6hte Petrus hire li\u00feian hand, ar\u00e6rde hi upp hale of \u00fe",
